.TH "ARC-CREATE" "1" "2026-09-27" "arc-cli" "Arc Manual"
.SH "NAME"
arc\-create \- create an archive or compressed stream
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
arc create ARCHIVE INPUT... [OPTIONS]
.PP
arcmk ...
.PP
arc\-create ...
.PP
arcpack ...
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Create a new archive or compressed stream transactionally. Format may be inferred from the destination or selected explicitly with \-F/\-\-format or a short suffix selector.
.SH "OPTIONS"
\-F, \-\-format FORMAT
.nf
\-zip       zip        default suffix .zip
.fi
.nf
\-7z        7z         default suffix .7z
.fi
.nf
\-rar       rar        default suffix .rar
.fi
.nf
\-tar       tar        default suffix .tar
.fi
.nf
\-targz     tar.gz     default suffix .tar.gz
.fi
.nf
\-tgz       tar.gz     default suffix .tgz
.fi
.nf
\-tarbz2    tar.bz2    default suffix .tar.bz2
.fi
.nf
\-tbz2      tar.bz2    default suffix .tbz2
.fi
.nf
\-tbz       tar.bz2    default suffix .tbz
.fi
.nf
\-tarxz     tar.xz     default suffix .tar.xz
.fi
.nf
\-txz       tar.xz     default suffix .txz
.fi
.nf
\-tarzst    tar.zstd   default suffix .tar.zst
.fi
.nf
\-tzst      tar.zstd   default suffix .tzst
.fi
.nf
\-tarzstd   tar.zstd   default suffix .tar.zstd
.fi
.nf
\-gz        gzip       default suffix .gz
.fi
.nf
\-gzip      gzip       default suffix .gzip
.fi
.nf
\-bz2       bzip2      default suffix .bz2
.fi
.nf
\-xz        xz         default suffix .xz
.fi
.nf
\-zst       zstd       default suffix .zst
.fi
.nf
\-zstd      zstd       default suffix .zstd
.fi
.PP
\-\-add\-extension
.PP
\-\-destination\-policy fail|replace|rename|skip\-identical
.PP
\-\-backup\-existing [PATH]
.PP
\-\-overwrite (legacy replace alias)
.PP
\-\-level 0..9
.PP
\-\-threads N
.PP
\-\-include/\-\-exclude and rule files
.PP
\-\-follow\-symlinks
.PP
\-\-one\-file\-system
.SH "SEMANTICS"
A short suffix selector is authoritative even when the destination has a conflicting recognized suffix. If the destination has no recognized suffix, the selector appends its represented suffix. Plain \-F/\-\-format keeps an explicitly supplied extensionless destination unless \-\-add\-extension is present.
.SH "EXAMPLES"
arc create backup src/ \-tzst
.PP
arcmk photos Photos/ \-7z \-\-level 8
.PP
arc create misleading.rar \-7z data/
.SH "SEE ALSO"
arc(1), arc\-formats(7), arc\-backends(7), arc\-remote(7)
